# TODO

## P1 - Critical fixes required before release

- [ ] Fix CLI exit handling in `toolkit/main.go`
  - Ensure `cmd.Execute()` errors are propagated and the process exits non-zero on failure.
- [ ] Fix kubeconfig precedence in `toolkit/toolkit/k8s/client.go`
  - Correct the current-directory fallback logic so it is checked on successful `os.Getwd()`, not on failure.
- [ ] Add automated Go test execution to CI
  - Run `go test` for maintained Go modules in PRs and merges.
- [ ] Harden readiness condition validation in `toolkit/toolkit/k8s/verify.go`
  - Validate unstructured values before assertions and avoid fragile condition-count logic.
- [ ] Define explicit readiness semantics
  - Document which status fields are required, supported, and how malformed objects should behave.

